    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000syx6](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000syx6) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on May 20 2026 21km N of Sincik. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 38.2157 longitude 38.6061. It impacted 603708 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
